                  <decoDesc>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d1" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#1v"/>
                        <desc><persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9684Uriel">Uriel</persName> gives <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3943Ezra">Ezra</persName> the
                           cup of wisdom. <q xml:lang="am">ቅዱስ፡ ዑራኤል፡ ለነቢዩ፡ ለእዝራ፡ ጽዋዓ፡ ልቡና፡ እንዳጠጣው።
                              እዝራ፡ ጽዋዓ፡ ልቡና፡ በዑራኤል፡ እጅ፡ እንዳጠጣ።</q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d2" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#2r"/>
                        <desc>Two Ethiopian monks: <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS8711sehmas">Ṣǝḥmā</persName> and <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS14471AkalaKrestos">Akāla Krǝstos</persName>. A serpent is swallowing the beard of
                              <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS14471AkalaKrestos">Akāla Krǝstos</persName>, while the holy monk is
                           absorbed in prayer. <q xml:lang="am">አባ፡ ጽሕማ። አቡነ፡ አካለ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ዘሀገረ፡ ነጋሳ፡
                              ከሚጸልዩበት፡ ዘንድ፡ አፋቸውን፡ እንጎራሳቸው፡</q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d3" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#5v"/>
                        <desc>A miniature of the <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1031VirginAndChild">Virgin and Child</ref> and two <term key="angel" ana="#angel">Angels</term>. <q xml:lang="am">ቅዱስ፡ ሚካኤል፡
                              ምስለ፡ ፍቁር፡ ወልዳ፡ እግዝእት፡ ማርያም፡ ቅዱስ፡ ገብርኤል፡</q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d4" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#10v"/>
                        <desc>A miniature of St. <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10581Zamika">Zamikāʾel ʾAragāwi</persName>. <q xml:lang="am">አቡነ፡ አረጋዊ፡ ዘደብረ፡ ዳሞ<supplied reason="omitted">።</supplied></q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d5" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#29v"/>
                        <desc>A miniature of St. <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS8491Samuel">Sāmuʾel of Wāldǝbbā</persName>. <q xml:lang="am">አቡነ፡ ሳሙኤል፡ ዘሀገረ፡ ዋልድባ።</q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d6" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#43r"/>
                        <desc>The miracle of St. <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS6006Kiros">Cyrus the Anchorite</persName>. <q xml:lang="am">ክርስቶስም፡ ቃልኪዳን፡ እንደሰጣቸው፡ አቡነ፡ ኪሮስ፡ አርባ፡ ዓመት፡ ከመሬት፡ ውድቀው፡ እንደጸለዩና፡ ሰር፡
                              እንደበቀለባቸው፡</q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d7" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#46v"/>
                        <desc>A miniature of <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS6751Mark">Mark</persName></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d8" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#101r"/>
                        <desc>A miniature of the <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1012Equestrian">Equestrian Saint</ref>,
                              <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS4585Georgeo">St George of Lydda</persName> slaying the dragon. <q xml:lang="am">ቅዱስ፡ ጊዮርጊስ፡ ድራጎንን፡ እንደገደለ፡ ቢራታዊትን፡ እንዳደነ፡</q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d9" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#112r"/>
                        <desc>Two episodes of the martyrdom of <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS4585Georgeo">St George of Lydda</persName>. <q xml:lang="am">ቅዱስ፡ ጊዮርጊስን፡ <sic>ከመለት፡</sic> ቤት፡ <choice>
                                 <sic>አገብተ፡</sic>
                                 <corr>አገቡት፡</corr>
                              </choice> እንዳሰሩት፡ የቤቱን፡ ምሰሶ፡ ዘተሰራበት፡ እንዳለመለመው። ቅዱስ፡ ጊዮርጊስን፡ ሶስት፡ ልሳን፡
                              ብረት፡ አግለው፡ በመቀመጨውና፡ በጅ፡ በግሩ፡ እንደቸንከሩት፡</q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d10" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#112v"/>
                        <desc>A miniature of the <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1030Trinity">The Trinity</ref> with
                           the <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1014Evangelists">Evangelists</ref>. <q xml:lang="am">ገጸ፡ ስብእ፡ ገጸ፡ ንስር፡ ገጸ፡ አንበሳ፡ ገጸ፡ ላህም፡ ቅድስት፡ ሥላሴ፡ አብ፡ ወልድ፡ መንፈስ፡
                              ቅዱስ፡</q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d11" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#113r"/>
                        <desc><persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS7049Michael">Michael</persName> and <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS4377Gabriel">Gabriel</persName>.
                              <q xml:lang="am">ቅዱስ፡ ሚካኤልና፡ ቅዱስ፡ ገብርኤል፡ ከሥላሴ፡ ምሕረት፡
                                 <choice><sic>እንዱለመኑ፡</sic><corr>እንደለመኑ፡</corr></choice></q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d12" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#186v"/>
                        <desc><persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS4306GabraMa">Gabra Manfas Qǝddus</persName> with <term key="animal" ana="#animal">lions and
                              leopards</term>. <q xml:lang="am">አቡነ፡ ገብረ፡ መንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ዘደብረ፡ ዝቋላ፡ ስሳ፡
                              እናብስት፡ ስሳ፡ አናምርት፡ እንደተከተሏቸው።</q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d13" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#187r"/>
                        <desc><persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9162TaklaHa">Takla Hāymānot</persName>. <q xml:lang="am">አቡነ፡ ተክለሐይማኖት፡
                              ዘደብረ፡ ሊባኖስ።</q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d14" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#187v"/>
                        <desc>A miniature of the <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1065RoadtoCalvary">Road to Calvary</ref>. <q xml:lang="am">ኵርአተ፡ ርእሱ፡ ለመድኃኔዓለም።</q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d15" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#188r"/>
                        <desc><persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus Christ</persName> carrying the <term key="cross" ana="#cross"/>. <q xml:lang="am">ማርቆስ፡ ምዕራፍ፡ ፲፭ቁጥር፡ ፳፩።</q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d16" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#188v"/>
                        <desc><q xml:lang="en">Woman, behold your son</q>. <q xml:lang="am">ሕያው፡
                              መድኃኔዓለም። እምቤታችን፡ እግረ፡ መስቀል፡ እንዳለቀሰች<supplied reason="lost">።</supplied> ዮሐንስ፡ <choice>
                                 <sic>ፍቁራ</sic>
                                 <corr>ፍቁሩ</corr>
                              </choice>፡ እግዚ<supplied reason="lost">አብሔር</supplied></q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d17" type="miniature">
                        <locus target="#189r"/>
                        <desc><persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS13687JosephArim">Joseph of Arimathea</persName> and <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS13688Nicodemus">Nicodemus</persName> prepare the <term key="deadjesus" ana="#deadjesus">body of
                                 <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus Christ</persName></term> for burial. <q xml:lang="am">ዮሴፍና፡ ኒቆዲሞስ፡ እንደገነዙት፡ እምቤታችን፡ እንዳለቀሰች፡ ክርስቶ<supplied reason="lost">ስ</supplied>፡ እንደሩቅ፡ ብእሲ፡ ዝም፡ በላችሁ፡ አትገንዙኝ፡ ቅዱስ፡
                              እግዚአብሔር፡ ቅዱስ፡ ኃይል፡ ቅዱስ፡ ሕያው፡ ዘኢይመውት፡ እያላችሁ፡ ነውጅ፡
                        እንዳል፡</q></desc></decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d18">
                        <locus target="#6r #11r #20v #24v #29vb #36r #40r #43v #48r #101rb #114r"/>
                        <desc>Elaborate, coloured (blue, red, yellow and occasionally also green and
                           violet), horizontal ornamental bands (ḥarags) over columns a–b (or over
                           column b only), with three lateral extensions reaching halfway across the
                           page, featuring interlaces and floral motifs.</desc>
                     </decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d19">
                        <locus target="#109vb"/>
                        <desc>A line of blue, black and red dots for separating parts of the
                           text.</desc>
                     </decoNote>
                     <decoNote xml:id="d20">
                        <locus target="#183vb"/>
                        <desc>A line of black and red dots for separating parts of the text.</desc>
                     </decoNote>
                  </decoDesc>
